  m_text: Almond moves by plotting a path. Once the player presses the move button,
    then use WASD to make a path that you want to travel. There is a limited number
    of spaces Almond can move in a turn. Once Almond moves, they can not move again
    until the next player's turn, even if not all movement spaces were used. Pips
    are located around the map; plot over them to cast more spells.
